WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:04.450
- What I am most appreciative
about my husband...

00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:07.444
- He does all the stuff that I'm bad at

00:00:07.444 --> 00:00:08.538
and I don't want to do.

00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:10.814
- I really do think it's
a 50/50 partnership.

00:00:10.814 --> 00:00:14.477
(light guitar music)

00:00:14.477 --> 00:00:16.060
- My husband, he is

00:00:16.919 --> 00:00:18.406
my best buddy.

00:00:18.406 --> 00:00:20.195
- You know, I love that he involves them

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:22.552
in things that he loves
like sports and working out.

00:00:22.552 --> 00:00:24.492
- He supports all my crazy ideas.

00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:26.586
- I was a single mother when I met him,

00:00:26.586 --> 00:00:29.660
and he has taken my oldest son

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.634
and has been a father to him.

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.263
- I think that the longer we're married

00:00:33.263 --> 00:00:36.157
and the longer we do the
parenting gig together,

00:00:36.157 --> 00:00:38.200
The more we appreciate each other.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.054
- He picks them up, he'll drop them off.

00:00:40.054 --> 00:00:42.583
He's the coach of the soccer team.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:46.697
- He hates the term that
he's watching our daughter,

00:00:46.697 --> 00:00:48.955
he's like, "No, I'm being a father."

00:00:48.955 --> 00:00:52.027
- He's really understanding
that it is work being a parent.

00:00:52.027 --> 00:00:55.999
- Like, he's so good about not leaving me

00:00:55.999 --> 00:00:58.224
to just do everything.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.353
- I'm kind of like this
monster ball of stress

00:01:00.353 --> 00:01:02.591
who can't deal with any of the kids,

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:05.077
you know, I can't have all three

00:01:05.077 --> 00:01:06.096
yelling at me at one time.

00:01:06.096 --> 00:01:08.026
And he's just like, "I
got this, it's fine."

00:01:08.026 --> 00:01:09.712
- He is present when he's home.

00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:13.879
- Most important, he's trying
to raise confident kids.

00:01:22.991 --> 00:01:26.447
(whooshing and squeaking)

